log             log.FE-3mer1-IM append
units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p

pair_style      lj/cut 5.000
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     cosine/periodic
dihedral_style  harmonic
improper_style  fourier

dielectric      1.0
pair_modify     tail yes mix arithmetic
special_bonds   lj/coul 0.0 0.0 1.0
box tilt        large
read_data       data.FE-3mer1-IM

#### Atom Groupings ####
group           fram     id   1:120
#### END Atom Groupings ####

